 # Design analysis for the D2 variant
 # ----------------------------------
-# a) Concrete form and behavior trace
-#    - The palette is no longer a 2xN / Nx2 edge block. Instead it is a single
-#      diagonal run starting at one grid corner and moving inward one step at a
-#      time. Example for N=3 from the top-left corner:
-#          (0,0)=border1, (1,1)=fill1, (2,2)=border2, (3,3)=fill2, (4,4)=border3, (5,5)=fill3
-#    - Each mapping pair therefore occupies two adjacent diagonal pixels.
-#    - The solver still fills enclosed background holes inside hollow sprites.
-#      The changed step is only how the border->fill mapping is read.
-#    - Trace:
-#      old rule: find an edge block, read one row/col as keys and the other as values.
-#      new rule: find a corner-anchored diagonal streak, read even-indexed cells
-#      along the diagonal as keys and odd-indexed cells as values.
-#      difference: reading direction is diagonal and anchored by a corner instead
-#      of horizontal/vertical and anchored by a whole edge segment.
+# a) 具体化与行为追踪
+#    - 原题的图例是边缘上的 2xN / Nx2 矩形块；本变体把它改成“从上边或下边出发、沿对角线向网格内部延伸”的单像素链。
+#    - 调色板长度为 2N 个像素，按读取顺序分组为
+#      (border_1, fill_1), (border_2, fill_2), ...
+#      其中同一对的两个像素彼此对角相邻；读取方向始终是“从贴边的第一个像素往内读”。
+#    - 具体例子：若顶边起点在第 1 列，方向为右下，则像素序列是
