 # Design analysis for the D2 variant
 # ----------------------------------
-# a) Concrete form and behavior trace
-#    - The palette is no longer a 2xN / Nx2 edge block. Instead it is a single
-#      diagonal run starting at one grid corner and moving inward one step at a
-#      time. Example for N=3 from the top-left corner:
-#          (0,0)=border1, (1,1)=fill1, (2,2)=border2, (3,3)=fill2, (4,4)=border3, (5,5)=fill3
-#    - Each mapping pair therefore occupies two adjacent diagonal pixels.
-#    - The solver still fills enclosed background holes inside hollow sprites.
-#      The changed step is only how the border->fill mapping is read.
-#    - Trace:
-#      old rule: find an edge block, read one row/col as keys and the other as values.
-#      new rule: find a corner-anchored diagonal streak, read even-indexed cells
-#      along the diagonal as keys and odd-indexed cells as values.
-#      difference: reading direction is diagonal and anchored by a corner instead
-#      of horizontal/vertical and anchored by a whole edge segment.
+# a) 具体化与行为追踪
+#    - 原题的图例是边缘上的 2xN / Nx2 矩形块；本变体把它改成“从上边或下边出发、沿对角线向网格内部延伸”的单像素链。
+#    - 调色板长度为 2N 个像素，按读取顺序分组为
+#      (border_1, fill_1), (border_2, fill_2), ...
+#      其中同一对的两个像素彼此对角相邻；读取方向始终是“从贴边的第一个像素往内读”。
+#    - 具体例子：若顶边起点在第 1 列，方向为右下，则像素序列是
+#      (0,1)=8, (1,2)=3, (2,3)=4, (3,4)=6
+#      表示 8->3、4->6 两组映射。原题会把同样的信息编码成两行矩形块；本变体要求沿斜线按偶/奇位置配对。
+#    - 洞填充流程本身不变：先找空心精灵的封闭背景区域，再看该区域四邻最常见的边框颜色，最后用调色板映射到填充色。
 #
-# b) Complexity calibration
-#    - Four corner anchors are allowed: top-left, top-right, bottom-left,
-#      bottom-right. This gives visible variation without exploding the rule set.
-#    - Palette length remains 2-5 pairs, matching the original difficulty.
-#    - Border keys and fill values stay unique within the palette, so the
-#      diagonal legend is readable and does not collapse into ambiguous repeats.
-#
-# c) Old implicit assumptions that must be replaced
-#    - Original _best_palette assumed a dense 2-row/2-col rectangle on an edge.
-#      That is invalid now because palette cells are sparse and diagonal.
-#    - Original _palette_mapping assumed a full row/column can be sliced out and
-#      zipped. That also breaks now; the mapping must be reconstructed from the
-#      ordered diagonal cells.
-#    - _fill_enclosed_bg_regions does not depend on palette geometry, only on the
-#      computed mapping and palette mask, so it remains valid.
+# b) 复杂度校准
+#    - 只保留 4 种“从边缘向内”的对角方向：`top_dr`, `top_dl`, `bottom_ur`, `bottom_ul`。
+#      不再同时开放左/右边起始，避免分支过多导致 2-4 个样例里不易归纳。
+#    - 调色板对数 N 取 2-4。这样可以保证 border / fill / distractor 都使用互不相同的非背景色，
+#      视觉上更清楚，也避免颜色重叠削弱“对角线成对读取”的线索。
+#    - 为了让图例仍然显眼，起点会靠近左右边缘，使对角线图例明显像“贴着外框伸进来的一条斜链”。
 #
-# d) Placement legality
-#    - The generator reserves the palette's diagonal bounding square plus a
-#      one-cell moat in the occupancy mask. This prevents sprite overlap and
-#      avoids accidental adjacency that could confuse palette detection.
-#    - The palette length N is capped by floor(min(H,W)/2), because each pair
-#      needs two diagonal cells.
+# c) 隐式假设审查（针对原 main）
+#    - 原 `_best_palette` 假设调色板一定是 2 行或 2 列的连续矩形，并且能从一整行/列取到 border 与 fill。
